kate beckinsale alleges Harvey Weinstein  sexually harassed her as a teenager on  Thursday morning the 44 year old posted  a photo to Instagram of herself at a  younger age claiming in the caption that  the embattled movie mogul had called her  to a meeting in his hotel room when she  was 17 years old quote he opened the  door in his bathrobe it did not cross my  mind that this older unattractive man  would expect me to have any sexual  interest in him the underworld star  added that she left the alleged meeting  feeling quote uneasy but unscathed  she then claims that a few years later  Weinstein asked her if he had tried  anything with her in that first meeting  quote I realized he couldn't remember if  he had assaulted me or not  Beckinsale is the latest in a string of  Hollywood actresses alleging that  Weinstein had sexually harassed them  following the New York Times initial  article last Thursday which accused the  producer of sexual misconduct dating  back three decades in a statement to et  Weinstein's lawyer Charles J harder  called the New York Times report quote  saturated with false and defamatory  statements on Tuesday it was reported  that Weinstein was planning on leaving  the country to seek treatment for sex  addiction but a source told ET on  Wednesday that the film producer flew to  Arizona instead at the advice of his  brother Bob adding that there is a  continuing discussion within Weinstein's  team about where he will officially  receive his treatment  then on Thursday London's Metropolitan  Police told ET they have opened an  investigation based on an allegation of  sexual assault by Weinstein that was  reported on Wednesday the NYPD also  confirmed to ET that they are conducting  a review to determine if there are any  additional complaints  [Music]
 

